  "accuracyNote": "Approximate boundary: the parcels the City listed for the plan on CEQAnet, as the County maps them, joined over the streets between them (25 m closing). 249.4 acres as drawn, streets included, against the notice's approximately 244 acres. 11 listed APNs aren't in the County's current layer; the re-mapped successors of four of them that lie inside the notice's Project Boundary are drawn. The list and the notice's small-scale Figure 2 differ at the edges: the parcels take in residential blocks along Franklin, Benton, Alviso and Fremont streets, a Santa Clara University parcel on Franklin Street, parcels on De La Cruz Boulevard and Grant Street and two San Jos\u00e9 parcels on Campbell Avenue that the figure's dashed line leaves out or crosses. The notice's written bounds and acreage fit the parcels. The outline traced from Figure 2 came to 208.2 acres; the two lie up to 301 m apart.",
